WEBVTT

00:16.030 --> 00:19.460
Um, where are we going?

00:19.460 --> 00:21.090
To Tilty's place.

00:21.370 --> 00:25.680
Tilty... You mean the eldest 
daughter of Marquess Claret?

00:26.000 --> 00:26.990
Yep.

00:28.940 --> 00:33.270
I seem to recall that her inhumane 
nature has caused repeated problems,

00:33.270 --> 00:35.590
and that she's been locked up 
in a separate building...

00:35.590 --> 00:38.060
Yep. That's pretty much right.

00:42.440 --> 00:45.950
Lady Tilty isn't, um... dangerous, is she?

00:46.470 --> 00:49.100
Oh, yeah. She's super dangerous.

00:51.850 --> 00:54.060
She is certainly unusual.

00:54.060 --> 00:57.210
She is the princess's 
research partner, after all.

00:58.920 --> 01:01.870
In other words, she's the 
same type as the princess.

02:33.500 --> 02:42.010
The Magical Revolution

02:33.500 --> 02:42.010
The Magical Revolution

02:33.500 --> 02:42.010
of the Reincarnated Princess and the Genius Young Lady

02:58.790 --> 03:01.810
My lady, I've brought visitors for you.

03:02.620 --> 03:04.050
Let them in.

03:12.660 --> 03:14.270
It's been a long time.

03:16.440 --> 03:17.940
Sure has!

03:17.940 --> 03:21.130
And is that the beloved 
daughter of Duke Magenta?

03:21.630 --> 03:24.210
Yeah! She's my cute, sweet assistant!

03:24.210 --> 03:26.830
My name is Euphyllia Magenta.

03:26.830 --> 03:29.400
It's a pleasure to meet you, Lady Claret.

03:29.400 --> 03:32.900
Call me Tilty. I hate formalities.

03:32.900 --> 03:35.830
Your rank's higher than mine, anyway.

03:36.230 --> 03:37.430
Right...

03:37.640 --> 03:42.230
So why did you come meekly trailing along 
with her if you're just going to be silent?

03:47.120 --> 03:51.400
I wanted to get your advice 
regarding this dragon magicite.

03:51.400 --> 03:53.880
Wow, so this is what 
I've heard so much about.

03:53.880 --> 03:58.450
You want me to use this the next time 
I synthesize magic medicine, then?

03:58.450 --> 04:00.110
Actually, nope!

04:00.110 --> 04:03.170
I want to test out a new technique with it!

04:03.170 --> 04:06.800
You didn't come up with some 
deranged idea again, did you?

04:06.800 --> 04:08.420
No, no!

04:09.630 --> 04:12.850
I was cursed by that dragon.

04:14.700 --> 04:19.640
Actually, it might be more correct to say 
it entrusted me with knowledge!

04:20.850 --> 04:22.190
What did you say?!

04:27.830 --> 04:29.870
What's this about a dragon's curse?

04:29.870 --> 04:31.800
Give me more details! Right now!

04:32.330 --> 04:34.780
There's that dark, creepy hobby of yours.

04:34.780 --> 04:36.480
What is this all about?

04:36.480 --> 04:38.500
Tilty is a curse specialist.

04:39.460 --> 04:41.390
Lady Tilty studies curses,

04:41.390 --> 04:46.430
meaning medical cases that can't 
be cured with medicine or magic.

04:46.430 --> 04:49.680
I-I see... But why...

04:49.680 --> 04:53.220
Miss Anis didn't tell you 
about my condition?

04:53.220 --> 04:56.570
I believe she said that when you use magic, 
you become unbalanced,

04:56.570 --> 04:59.030
causing adverse effects 
on your mental state.

04:59.030 --> 05:00.780
Yes, and due to that...

05:02.280 --> 05:04.600
Well, I've made some pretty big messes.

05:04.600 --> 05:09.580
When a noble can't even use magic right, 
what else can you call it but a curse?

05:13.870 --> 05:17.070
So that made me lose all interest in magic,

05:17.550 --> 05:19.970
and I decided to pursue medicine instead.

05:20.360 --> 05:26.050
I see. Your own suffering has 
made you want to help others.

05:26.050 --> 05:28.130
That's a wonderful attitude!

05:30.090 --> 05:34.550
There's nothing that admirable about Tilty!

05:36.040 --> 05:40.720
She's just a weirdo who finds 
pleasure in cracking curses!

05:40.720 --> 05:42.360
I don't need that from a freak

05:42.360 --> 05:45.970
who risks her life to study magic 
when she can't even use it.

05:46.790 --> 05:47.440
And?

05:48.120 --> 05:51.660
What does Miss Anis the Freak 
want me to do?

06:10.120 --> 06:12.930
You're just as mad as ever, I see.

06:12.930 --> 06:16.140
Um, would you mind showing me 
those papers, as well?

06:16.440 --> 06:19.320
The knowledge I got from the dragon 
gave me the idea!

06:19.720 --> 06:22.780
I could absorb the magicite's 
power safely this way, right?

06:23.690 --> 06:27.260
You really intend to take 
this thing into yourself?

06:27.260 --> 06:27.740
Yep!

06:30.480 --> 06:33.150
What are we to do with you, Princess?

06:37.080 --> 06:40.160
Well, it sounds interesting, 
so I'm fine with it.

06:40.680 --> 06:42.050
Miss Anis...

06:43.450 --> 06:45.520
I understand.

06:45.520 --> 06:48.090
But please, don't do anything dangerous.

07:08.510 --> 07:12.060
Princess, you've just received 
a message from the castle.

07:13.090 --> 07:14.470
A message?

07:14.470 --> 07:17.610
Yes. A summons from His Majesty.

07:17.610 --> 07:19.720
You are to visit the castle tomorrow.

07:20.310 --> 07:22.170
I-I-I didn't do anything!

07:22.590 --> 07:26.260
Perhaps he caught wind of your 
experiments with Lady Tilty?

07:28.110 --> 07:30.140
You think he'll be angry?

07:30.140 --> 07:32.560
Do you think he <i>won't</i> be angry?

07:32.560 --> 07:34.560
I wanna run away!

07:34.560 --> 07:37.550
If you do that, I believe it 
will only anger him more.

07:38.690 --> 07:40.080
Good point...

07:45.960 --> 07:48.100
Well, here I am.

07:54.150 --> 07:56.890
I, Anisphia, have come to—

08:00.870 --> 08:03.030
Welcome, Anisphia.

08:03.030 --> 08:06.990
M-Mother?! Why are you here?! 
You're alive?!

08:07.390 --> 08:08.960
Yes, I'm alive.

08:09.670 --> 08:11.920
And do you even need to ask why?

08:11.920 --> 08:13.760
With so many terrible incidents happening,

08:13.760 --> 08:16.540
I can't comfortably focus on diplomatic work.

08:16.540 --> 08:18.390
I just returned from abroad yesterday,

08:18.390 --> 08:21.860
and it sounds as if you've been quite active.

08:21.860 --> 08:23.950
After all these years,

08:23.950 --> 08:27.160
is it time for your mother 
to educate you again?

08:28.420 --> 08:30.240
For now, just sit down.

08:30.240 --> 08:32.450
O-Okay...

08:39.200 --> 08:41.100
Oh, never mind.

08:41.100 --> 08:45.200
We called you here today 
to talk about Algard.

08:45.200 --> 08:47.500
Huh? About Al?

08:47.500 --> 08:51.830
Yes. We've finally collated 
all of the information.

08:59.880 --> 09:03.060
Hey, so Euphie really isn't to blame at all!

09:03.060 --> 09:06.010
That's true, but it's just a bit strange.

09:09.770 --> 09:15.950
All of the people who questioned Miss Cyan 
are sympathetic toward her.

09:15.950 --> 09:18.400
Sympathetic?

09:18.400 --> 09:24.440
Yes. There are those who believe 
some of the fault lies with Euphyllia.

09:24.440 --> 09:27.470
Though it clearly does not, 
if one considers the circumstances...

09:27.470 --> 09:30.580
So I've decided to summon 
Baron Cyan's daughter here

09:30.580 --> 09:33.270
and hear what she has to say in person.

09:33.270 --> 09:35.720
I'd like you to be present 
at that time. Will you?

09:36.090 --> 09:39.190
I'm definitely interested, but...

09:39.770 --> 09:43.250
You may be an outlandishly wild daughter,

09:43.250 --> 09:45.640
but that doesn't mean we don't trust you.

09:46.070 --> 09:49.430
With your intuition 
and your unique point of view,

09:49.430 --> 09:51.880
you might notice something that we don't.

09:52.340 --> 09:53.610
We'll be counting on you.

09:57.590 --> 09:58.430
Okay.

10:13.600 --> 10:17.750
So... they decided to hear 
what Lady Lainie has to say,

10:17.750 --> 10:19.420
but something seems kinda weird...

10:19.830 --> 10:22.650
You mean how people sympathize with her?

10:22.950 --> 10:25.350
I don't think it's that hard to believe.

10:27.500 --> 10:32.560
Some stupid boys just wanted to show off 
for a pretty damsel in distress.

10:32.560 --> 10:34.990
And the head of the idiots 
is that idiot prince.

10:34.990 --> 10:37.440
Hey! He's still my brother, you know!

10:38.250 --> 10:41.660
I mean, yeah, he <i>is</i> stupid... He is, but...

10:41.660 --> 10:44.460
Apparently, some of the ladies 
feel that way, too.

10:45.620 --> 10:48.090
It's not just students at the academy,

10:48.090 --> 10:49.950
but people at the castle, too.

10:49.950 --> 10:53.860
Everyone who's talked to 
Miss Lainie is the same way.

10:53.860 --> 10:54.790
Isn't that crazy?

10:56.270 --> 11:00.000
So everyone who interacts with her 
ends up favoring her?

11:00.480 --> 11:02.970
I might have an idea why that is.

11:02.970 --> 11:06.130
Ooh! That's my dark-hearted curse nerd!

11:06.130 --> 11:07.670
You want to be cursed to death?

11:07.670 --> 11:10.390
Oh, sorry! I mean, great master of curses!

11:11.210 --> 11:13.110
You're making fun of me, aren't you?

11:16.390 --> 11:18.890
And what is your opinion, Master Tilty?

11:19.690 --> 11:23.570
Strictly speaking, it's not 
really a curse, but...

11:33.050 --> 11:36.720
Ow! Ow! That stings!

11:36.720 --> 11:39.220
Do that slower! Gentler! More carefully!

11:44.910 --> 11:47.090
And? How did it go?

11:47.090 --> 11:52.320
Oh, well... It seems like it's 
exactly as Tilty and I thought.

11:52.320 --> 11:58.300
Just to make sure, I talked to one of the 
people who was condemning Euphie,

11:58.640 --> 12:01.240
and he had no awareness of it at all.

12:02.660 --> 12:06.640
I just need to see Miss Lainie in person 
tomorrow for the final confirmation.

12:06.640 --> 12:08.240
Come with me, Ilia.

12:08.240 --> 12:11.650
I haven't the slightest idea 
what's going on, but very well.

12:11.650 --> 12:13.570
I will entrust everything to you.

12:13.570 --> 12:17.050
Leave it to me! I've already 
come up with a countermeasure.

12:17.460 --> 12:19.750
And is this your countermeasure?

12:20.430 --> 12:25.470
Yeah, well... it's more like 
I figure that's how it'll turn out.

12:25.470 --> 12:26.580
I see.

12:33.280 --> 12:36.140
I will begin making 
preparations for tomorrow.

12:36.140 --> 12:38.740
Try not to stay in the bath too long.

12:51.480 --> 12:55.620
I decided to condemn her 
at Prince Algard's suggestion.

13:00.270 --> 13:03.590
<i>Seriously, what the heck are you doing, Al?</i>

13:07.310 --> 13:09.440
It suits you, Princess.

13:10.080 --> 13:12.030
Yeah, thanks.

13:12.030 --> 13:12.890
Miss Anis!

13:13.380 --> 13:14.340
Euphie?

13:15.000 --> 13:16.180
You look beautiful.

13:16.180 --> 13:18.390
You don't have to flatter me.

13:18.890 --> 13:23.300
I do wish I could accompany you, 
but if I were there...

13:27.570 --> 13:30.410
It's okay. Just look after the place for me.

13:30.810 --> 13:33.700
Okay. I'll be awaiting your return.

13:50.700 --> 13:54.140
Baron Cyan, and his daughter, Lainie.

13:54.140 --> 13:55.730
Welcome.

13:55.730 --> 14:00.890
Your Majesty! Please forgive my 
daughter's horrendous insolence!

14:01.240 --> 14:03.400
Be at ease, Lord Cyan.

14:03.400 --> 14:07.950
I asked you here today in hope 
of bringing the truth to light.

14:07.950 --> 14:09.310
Just relax for now.

14:09.310 --> 14:11.510
Yes, Your Majesty. Please forgive me.

14:11.510 --> 14:14.130
I am deeply moved by your kindness.

14:14.530 --> 14:16.570
Miss Lainie Cyan, raise your head.

14:20.770 --> 14:25.710
If I may be direct, you and Algard 
developed feelings for one another, correct?

14:30.420 --> 14:30.880
No.

14:32.810 --> 14:34.930
Most certainly not.

14:34.930 --> 14:38.330
Such things are beyond my station, 
and I have not even entertained the notion.

14:38.940 --> 14:44.050
I would be lying if I said I did not 
think favorably of Prince Algard,

14:44.050 --> 14:46.310
but I would never dream of doing anything

14:46.310 --> 14:49.560
that would cast a dark shroud 
over the royal family's future.

14:50.380 --> 14:54.030
I see. You certainly don't seem to be lying.

14:55.110 --> 14:59.240
Indeed. There seems to be 
no falsehood in her heart.

14:59.780 --> 15:02.810
Perhaps there was some sort 
of misunderstanding.

15:04.220 --> 15:07.020
It is possible that Algard acted hastily.

15:07.330 --> 15:10.880
It seems likely that there was a sad 
misunderstanding on both sides.

15:11.320 --> 15:14.590
It is clear that no blame 
lies with Miss Cyan.

15:14.590 --> 15:18.260
Yes! I swear to you that my 
daughter meant no harm!

15:18.260 --> 15:20.860
Hmm... That seems to be true.

15:20.860 --> 15:22.520
<i>I don't feel right...</i>

15:37.150 --> 15:40.360
You are absolutely unbelievable!

15:40.360 --> 15:42.480
I-It's not like that, Father!

15:42.480 --> 15:44.960
I, Anisphia, would like 
to offer a suggestion!

15:44.960 --> 15:46.930
I won't hear any excuses!

15:46.930 --> 15:48.420
This is serious!

15:49.560 --> 15:50.890
Speak, then.

15:52.570 --> 15:54.790
Could you ask the others to leave?

15:54.790 --> 15:56.140
What?

15:56.140 --> 15:58.590
There's something I want 
to ask Miss Lainie.

15:59.210 --> 16:03.040
In the interest of protecting her dignity,

16:03.040 --> 16:06.400
I'd like to ask it in front of 
as few people as possible.

16:09.370 --> 16:11.000
I see no problem with this.

16:11.000 --> 16:14.390
Your Majesty, I trust Anis's intuition.

16:14.900 --> 16:18.860
W-Wait! My daughter really 
isn't planning anything!

16:19.260 --> 16:24.330
Princess Anisphia, don't you think 
asking us to leave is a bit hasty?

16:24.660 --> 16:26.790
Lord Chartreuse.

16:27.070 --> 16:31.100
Sending everyone away so you can 
question a poor, delicate young lady?

16:31.100 --> 16:34.760
Telling her not to be afraid 
is expecting too much.

16:35.030 --> 16:38.170
I understand what you're saying,

16:38.170 --> 16:41.470
but this is something that 
nobody but me can verify.

16:41.690 --> 16:44.080
Verify what?

16:44.080 --> 16:47.680
Are you saying you suspect 
Miss Cyan of wrongdoing?

16:47.680 --> 16:50.310
Do you object to what I've asked?

16:53.770 --> 16:56.320
The princess is clearly insisting.

16:56.320 --> 16:58.780
Should we not stand down, then?

17:00.620 --> 17:02.480
I will allow it.

17:02.480 --> 17:05.470
Anis and Miss Lainie may speak in private.

17:05.910 --> 17:07.880
All present, leave for now.

17:10.650 --> 17:12.320
Sorry to spring this on you.

17:12.320 --> 17:14.870
I just want to check something about you.

17:14.870 --> 17:17.980
Um, I really haven't done anything!

17:18.460 --> 17:21.600
I'm sorry, but I need to verify this now,

17:21.600 --> 17:23.430
or you may end up at a disadvantage.

17:23.740 --> 17:24.990
No...

17:27.720 --> 17:30.740
So the only answer you need 
to give is "yes." Okay?

17:31.340 --> 17:32.350
Yes...

17:34.310 --> 17:35.640
Wh-What are you—

17:35.640 --> 17:37.780
Quiet, now. I won't do anything to you.

17:38.310 --> 17:39.350
Pardon me.

17:44.480 --> 17:46.470
Okay, got it. All done.

17:55.620 --> 17:56.890
Miss Lainie...

17:56.890 --> 17:58.500
Wh-What is it?

17:59.010 --> 18:02.220
Are you aware that you're using magic?

18:02.480 --> 18:03.350
Huh?

18:05.180 --> 18:07.710
Great, so you don't realize it?

18:07.710 --> 18:09.320
This is a problem.

18:09.320 --> 18:12.690
Huh? Um, I... I'm not using any magic...

18:12.690 --> 18:16.120
I-I don't know what you're talking about! 
I didn't do anything!

18:16.120 --> 18:20.310
Yeah, I get it. I know you're 
not doing it of your own will.

18:25.180 --> 18:27.680
Miss Lainie, I'm pretty sure... I think...

18:27.680 --> 18:29.620
that you're not an ordinary human.

18:30.070 --> 18:33.320
N-Not an ordinary... human?

18:33.320 --> 18:35.040
Listen to me calmly.

18:35.480 --> 18:38.810
There's something in your heart 
that I believe to be magicite.

18:40.490 --> 18:43.930
M-Magicite? What? But how?

18:44.380 --> 18:48.160
I'm... n-not human?

18:48.160 --> 18:52.790
It's not that you're not human, 
but you're sort of like me.

18:52.790 --> 18:55.370
I've been researching magicite,

18:55.370 --> 18:58.820
and as part of that, 
I sort of took some into my body.

18:59.630 --> 19:01.660
And that's how I can tell.

19:01.660 --> 19:06.450
I think the magicite inside you seems to be 
a type that affects people's minds.

19:06.810 --> 19:08.830
To put it more simply,

19:08.830 --> 19:12.120
I believe you have the power of fascination.

19:12.350 --> 19:14.750
Fascination?

19:14.750 --> 19:15.580
Yep.

19:15.970 --> 19:20.100
Is that true?! Have I been 
doing that all this time?!

19:20.100 --> 19:23.500
Well, I don't know <i>that</i> much...

19:23.500 --> 19:25.810
But I think it's highly probable.

19:28.780 --> 19:33.490
People have always liked me,

19:33.490 --> 19:38.960
but that caused others to be mean to me, 
to betray me, to bully me...

19:39.990 --> 19:45.000
It made me so scared, 
I started trying to avoid being liked,

19:45.000 --> 19:47.040
to stand out as little as possible.

19:54.560 --> 19:56.190
<i>Fascination, huh?</i>

19:56.190 --> 20:00.010
<i>If not for the dragon's power, 
I would've been in trouble, too.</i>

20:03.340 --> 20:06.770
I never would have imagined there 
was someone with magicite in them.

20:06.770 --> 20:09.050
And to think it gives her the 
power of fascination...

20:09.380 --> 20:13.540
Yes, but I can't say for sure 
that she can control that power.

20:13.540 --> 20:16.330
That's probably why it 
activated indiscriminately

20:16.330 --> 20:18.130
against people who were kind to her,

20:18.130 --> 20:22.020
and why she began to experience 
friction in her relationships.

20:22.680 --> 20:24.590
That's...

20:33.810 --> 20:36.060
Her power is dangerous.

20:36.060 --> 20:37.950
It could threaten this entire nation.

20:38.420 --> 20:39.670
We may have to...

20:41.950 --> 20:45.100
There's no problem. 
I have a countermeasure.

20:46.730 --> 20:50.260
I will assume responsibility 
and take Miss Lainie in.

20:55.130 --> 20:58.890
Honestly... That's exactly 
what's wrong with you!

20:58.890 --> 20:59.390
Huh?

20:59.750 --> 21:04.370
Keeping Miss Lainie at your villa 
will cause major problems.

21:05.210 --> 21:06.060
Problems?

21:06.430 --> 21:09.290
Who are you living with right now?

21:09.290 --> 21:10.740
Oh!

21:18.460 --> 21:20.960
Episode Six







Getting to the Truth of the 
Annulment and the Fascination

22:53.620 --> 22:56.400
She is as unpredictable as ever.

22:56.400 --> 23:00.140
I never expected her to get involved in this.

23:00.140 --> 23:02.100
This means our plan is...

23:02.100 --> 23:06.000
The plan remains unchanged, 
but we may need to move faster.

23:06.910 --> 23:10.580
I should have known she would be the one 
to stand in my way in the end.

23:11.230 --> 23:13.540
What do you intend to do?

23:14.140 --> 23:18.060
She is a problem, 
but she is not without flaws.

23:18.060 --> 23:19.990
She has plenty of weaknesses 
we can exploit.

23:20.460 --> 23:24.210
Do that, then. 
Mistakes will not be tolerated.

23:24.610 --> 23:27.180
Yes, we can make no mistakes.

23:27.960 --> 23:31.130
This is the end of it, after all.

23:34.970 --> 23:39.970
Episode Seven







The Magic Lecture of the 
Founder and the Assistant
